# Kotlin / Compose

- One module. UI is Compose. DI is Hilt.
- Screens and ViewModels talk only to `FundRepository`. Never import Room, Retrofit/OkHttp/Ktor, or `TefasClient` from UI.
- ViewModels expose immutable UI state (`StateFlow` / data class). Keep side effects (refresh, follow) as explicit functions.
- Default copy and `res/values` strings are Turkish. Include “yatırım tavsiyesi değildir” on fund detail.
- On error: keep last cache, snackbar + retry. Never clear follows because a call failed.

```kotlin
// ❌ BAD — UI depends on the HTTP client
class WatchlistViewModel @Inject constructor(
    private val tefas: TefasClient,
)

// ✅ GOOD — UI depends on the repository
class WatchlistViewModel @Inject constructor(
    private val funds: FundRepository,
)
```

Fetch Compose, Hilt, Room, and Gradle DSL from Context7. Do not guess APIs.
